   "x": 751,
   "y": 120,
   "w": 666,
   "h": 98,
   "kind": "plain",
   "title": "MICROVASCULAR: GLUCOSE control prevents it",
   "lines": [
    "glycated hemoglobin (A1c) targets: see the GLYCEMIC GOALS chart"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "g_macro",
   "x": 1457,
